        {BRAND.name} is an early-stage, experimental ecommerce software project. Shopify, WooCommerce, Wix, Big Cartel
        and Shoplazza are trademarks of their respective owners and are referenced for comparison only. {BRAND.name} is not affiliated with any of them.
      </p>
      <p>Official website: <a href={`${BRAND.url}/`}>{BRAND.url}</a> · <a href="/llms.txt">llms.txt</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
